<section class="hero-section" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
  <div class="hero-top">
    <div class="frame-container grid-24 hero-top-grid">
      <div class="hero-headline-col">
        <h1 id="intro-title" class="hero-title" data-rolling-title>
          Grounded retrieval experiments &amp; practical backend development.
        </h1>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-lead-col">
        <p class="hero-copy" data-hero-appear>
          I&rsquo;m <strong>Thuan</strong>, a fresh graduate exploring AI &amp;
          Backend Engineering. I focus on the fundamentals: building reliable
          RAG pipelines over complex, messy documents, handling event telemetry,
          and practicing writing clean, maintainable asynchronous backend
          services.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-blueprint on-blue" data-nav-blue data-hero-panel>
    <div class="shaded-grid-layer" data-shaded-grid aria-hidden="true"></div>
